<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 18:52:51 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>沙特阿拉伯正在获得巨额石油暴利，这使其成为伊朗战争的唯一赢家。德黑兰的代理人实际上“帮了沙特一个忙”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/saudi-arabia-oil-windfall-crude-prices-exports-iran-war-winner-hormuz-red-sea/</link><description>“各位，在这个时候，沙特通过红海实现的任何出口都只是他们 100 美元/桶蛋糕上的糖霜。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2291436138-e1790603388865.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 16:30:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/saudi-arabia-oil-windfall-crude-prices-exports-iran-war-winner-hormuz-red-sea/</guid></item><item><title>习近平与特朗普峰会后，美中关系进入“战术自动驾驶”状态。也许这并没有那么糟糕</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/xi-trump-summit-us-china-relations-managed-decline/</link><description>两国不断出现分歧，但峰会缺乏实质内容，这表明北京和华盛顿希望稳定，而不是彻底决裂。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2296608969-e1790566027645.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 08:12:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/xi-trump-summit-us-china-relations-managed-decline/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普如何从 Elliott Management 手中夺取 Citgo 并将其交还给委内瑞拉</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/27/trump-citgo-elliott-management-venezuela/</link><description>Citgo 的命运可能取决于特朗普政府选择将其交给埃利奥特还是委内瑞拉。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2278567707.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 07:11:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/27/trump-citgo-elliott-management-venezuela/</guid></item><item><title>近一半的房屋卖家现在提供出售房产的激励措施——甚至提供 20,000 美元的优惠和全额费用的游轮</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/26/nearly-half-home-sellers-offering-incentives-concessions-buyers-market-redfin/</link><description>Redfin 首席经济学家达里尔·费尔韦瑟 (Daryl Fairweather) 表示：“如果我们量化所有这些让步……我们会看到房价下降，人们得到更好的交易。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1144545540-e1790367105978.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 08:21:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/26/nearly-half-home-sellers-offering-incentives-concessions-buyers-market-redfin/</guid></item><item><title>由于没有继承人，这位亿万富翁正将自己的财富投入到德克萨斯州一座约有 25 人的鬼城中。</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/27/with-no-heirs-to-leave-it-to-this-billionaire-is-pouring-his-fortune-into-a-texas-ghost-town-of-about-25-people/</link><description>81 岁的约翰·波因德克斯特 (John Poindexter) 是卡车车身制造商 JB Poindexter &amp;amp; Co. 的创始人，他希望将德克萨斯州的沙夫特变成一座活生生的历史博物馆。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-510188418-e1790356940879.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 09:43:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/27/with-no-heirs-to-leave-it-to-this-billionaire-is-pouring-his-fortune-into-a-texas-ghost-town-of-about-25-people/</guid></item><item><title>“我们在这里非常谨慎”：星际飞船首次进入轨道，但 SpaceX 在 3 小时后缩短了原定 10 小时的行程</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/spacex-starship-orbit-space-10-hour-three-launch/</link><description>NASA 局长贾里德·艾萨克曼 (Jared Isaacman) 祝贺 SpaceX 进入轨道并“以安全、负责任且特别鼓舞人心的方式管理每一步”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26271469877907-e1790610106106.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 15:51:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/spacex-starship-orbit-space-10-hour-three-launch/</guid></item><item><title>美国科学家正在把目光投向国外。欧洲企业能赚钱吗？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/americas-scientists-are-looking-abroad-can-european-business-cash-in/</link><description>随着美国研究经费面临压力，欧洲公司和机构正在寻求吸引美国顶尖的 STEM 人才。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2236239187_2880x1920.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 15:50:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/americas-scientists-are-looking-abroad-can-european-business-cash-in/</guid></item><item><title>截至 2026 年 9 月 28 日的当前石油价格</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-09-28-2026/</link><description>当油价变化时，它会影响您的能源成本，甚至日常用品的价格。原因如下。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Price-of-Oil-Sep-28.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 15:42:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-09-28-2026/</guid></item><item><title>加密货币海盗已成为海军。现在怎么办？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/the-crypto-pirates-have-become-the-navy-now-what/</link><description>加密行业已经深深陷入了华盛顿特区的生活方式，引发了人们对其真正代表什么的质疑。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2284078062.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:24:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/the-crypto-pirates-have-become-the-navy-now-what/</guid></item><item><title>亿万富翁大卫·鲁宾斯坦告诉年轻工人如何在人工智能时代学习阅读和写作：“学习如何有效且有说服力地说话”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/billionaire-david-rubenstein-tells-young-workers-learn-read-write-ai-era-learn-how-to-speak-effectively-persuasively/</link><description>这位凯雷联合创始人表示，阅读和写作的核心技能使人们“在过去的几千年里取得了成功”，并且永远不会改变。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2270924500-1-e1790607198441.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 15:36:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/billionaire-david-rubenstein-tells-young-workers-learn-read-write-ai-era-learn-how-to-speak-effectively-persuasively/</guid></item></channel></rss>